WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.390
The number one question I get
is how to play up your eyes.

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:04.895
I'm going to show
you the smoky eye.

00:00:04.895 --> 00:00:06.890
The smoky eye is layered.

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:12.630
Do not get a dark black shadow
and put it all over your eye.

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:16.145
My makeup philosophy is
that I like it to be quick.

00:00:16.145 --> 00:00:17.145
I like it to be natural.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.790
It's not about how you look.

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:22.200
It's about what
you do look like.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.290
Makeup is a way to
change the way you feel,

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:29.130
make you comfortable in your
skin, and enhance who you are.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:31.380
I love when she smiles,
you see the little lines.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:32.130
And you know what?

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:33.300
We have lines.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.290
And that's okay.

00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:37.540
You have to embrace
yourself, embrace your age.

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:40.770
No matter what color skin you
have, what color eyes you have,

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:42.718
what color hair you
have, anyone could

00:00:42.718 --> 00:00:44.010
make themselves look beautiful.

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:51.190
I'm going to teach you how to
cover up the little pesky spots

00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:53.860
on your face, how to use
anything from a pencil,

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:56.170
to a cream, to even coconut oil.

00:00:56.170 --> 00:00:58.630
This is like an ideal treatment.

00:00:58.630 --> 00:00:59.830
Bronzer 101.

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:01.000
Use a wide brush.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:02.680
Dip the brush in, tap it.

00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:03.790
Blow to get it off.

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:05.870
And that way, you don't
make a mess on the skin.

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:06.370
All right.

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:07.830
Let's do your eyes first.

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:09.370
Now, make sure
you're blending it.

00:01:09.370 --> 00:01:11.260
Fingers are the
best way to blend.

00:01:11.260 --> 00:01:12.370
Oh, I love this.

00:01:12.370 --> 00:01:14.860
I would like to demystify
your makeup kit.

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:19.510
You need a moisturizer, black
mascara, four shadows, a brush,

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:22.960
a pencil, and that's
pretty much it.

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:24.550
Makeup should not be a mask.

00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:27.460
Makeup should not
change the way you look.

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:30.220
You don't wear foundation to
change the color of your skin.

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:32.400
You don't contour your nose.

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:34.330
There is nothing
wrong with your nose.

00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:36.520
You don't overline your lips.

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:39.430
Makeup should
enhance who you are.

00:01:39.430 --> 00:01:40.750
She doesn't need anything else.

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:42.727
She looks absolutely gorgeous.

00:01:42.727 --> 00:01:44.435
You're going to call
me every day, right?

00:01:44.435 --> 00:01:46.390
BOBBI BROWN: Yeah, every day.

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:51.450
I'm Bobbi Brown, and
this is my MasterClass.

